hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1435","Muhammad bin Uzair al-Ayli told us that Salama told me, on the authority of Uqail, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, And peace be upon him. “When he went out to the prayer hall during Eid al-Adha and Eid al-Fitr, he would go out with the goat in front of him until it was centered in the prayer hall and he would pray with it, and that is because The prayer hall was a space in which there was nothing built to cover it.”"
